OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRather
OL,6,Fcloudy with rain in the evening,
OL,7,Fthough perhaps remaining mainly dry
OL,8,Ffor Fife. Rain becomes persistent and
OL,9,Fheavier overnight and spreads east to
OL,10,Fall areas.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FCloudy to start with
OL,13,Fpersistent and occasionally heavy
OL,14,Frain, and some blustery winds at
OL,15,Ftimes. This clears through the morning
OL,16,Fto allow increasing bright spells and
OL,17,Fa few showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
