OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDry
OL,6,Fand bright Thursday morning with a
OL,7,Fband of cloud and rain passing
OL,8,Fsoutheast in the evening. Friday will
OL,9,Fbecome dry with sunny spells. Bright
OL,10,Fspells and some showers Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
